t (docling/mineru/pymupdf4llm/lancedb) or when a cloud API key\r\n# is not configured (httpx for the provider adapters).\r\nlayer2 = [\r\n    \"docling>=2\",\r\n    \"mineru[all]\",\r\n    \"pymupdf4llm>=0.1\",\r\n    \"lancedb>=0.10\",\r\n    \"httpx>=0.27\",\r\n]\r\n\r\n[tool.setuptools.packages.find]\r\nwhere = [\"src\"]\r\n\r\n[tool.pytest.ini_options]\r\ntestpaths = [\"tests\"]\r\naddopts = \"-p no:cacheprovider\"\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
